      "package": "minimatch",
      "version": "3.1.5",
      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "mechanism": "At optimizationLevel >= 2, firstPhasePreProcess can amplify globParts and secondPhasePreProcess compares pattern pairs.",
      "evidence": "The exact 3.1.5 implementation has no optimizationLevel, firstPhasePreProcess or secondPhasePreProcess. Its make function maps brace-expanded strings to slash-separated components and parses those components directly, without the reported optimization pipeline.",
      "source": {
        "repository": "https://github.com/isaacs/minimatch",
        "commit": "7bba97888a27a6162983056bcce2a6e28f668712",
        "file": "minimatch.js",
